<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Employee Records & Organizational Charts</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            A comprehensive, search-optimized digital archive that maintains the absolute 
            historical and structural integrity of your organization's human capital.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">The Digital Personnel Dossier</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate traditional paper files with a centralized Employee Records module. 
            Every employee is assigned a definitive digital folder containing their full 
            personnel history—from initial application and contract signing to promotions, 
            salary adjustments, and disciplinary records. Store digitized contacts, 
            National IDs (NID), qualification certificates, and annual performance 
            reviews in a secure, search-optimized repository that ensures every piece of 
            evidence is retrievable in seconds.
        </p>
        <p>
            Comprehensive auditing captures every amendment to the employee record, 
            ensuring organizational compliance with data protection standards and 
            providing a forensic trail of historical HR actions.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Dynamic Organizational Visibility</h2>
        <p>
            Experience radical structural clarity with automated Organizational Charts. The 
            system generates a live representation of the company hierarchy directly 
            from the 'Reports To' metadata within individual employee files. As promotions 
            are processed or reporting lines adjusted, the chart updates instantly, 
            providing stakeholders with an accurate view of departmental structures, 
            vacant roles, and staff strength targets.
        </p>
        <p>
            Headcount reports can be aggregated by department, pay-grade, or geographic 
            location, providing the data necessary for strategic workforce modeling 
            and office space planning.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Compliance & Disciplinary Archival</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain rigorous adherence to the Labour Act with centralized Tracking of 
            disciplinary events and grievance logs. Record every step of the disciplinary 
            workflow—from initial incident reporting to final outcomes and warning 
            document attachments. This historical accountability is essential for 
            governance and provides a robust evidential basis for performance reviews 
            or potential labor relations discussions.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated alerts flag the expiration of professional certifications or 
            medicals, ensuring that your organization's staff are always fully 
            authorized and safe to perform their specialized duties.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

